{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Sword Game</strong> is a stylish, fast-paced hack and slash platformer set in a retro-inspired 3D world. Your mission: reclaim your homeland from demonic forces led by the wielder of the Dark Sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by early 2000s shareware titles, <i>The Sword Game</i> gives you complete freedom\u2014cheat, experiment, and find shortcuts. Every level is a speedrunner\u2019s playground, challenging you to react quickly and improve your best times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring a minimalist black and white aesthetic, this game combines modern level design with nostalgic visuals. If you're looking for a stylish and adrenaline-pumping action adventure, <i>The Sword Game</i> is your next challenge.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784730?t=1751388350","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784730?t=1751388350","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784730/1df0a4d078c5c20158bcb8d1a85e49481fb267e5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751388350","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784730/1df0a4d078c5c20158bcb8d1a85e49481fb267e5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751388350","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3814990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Sword Game</strong> is a stylish, fast-paced hack and slash platformer set in a retro-inspired 3D world. Your mission: reclaim your homeland from demonic forces led by the wielder of the Dark Sword.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by ea